  "description": "Toddlers Twist is a play cube for the youngest group in a playground, ages 3 to 8. Inside one pink and green frame there is a green slide, a swing and red climbing bars, so small children can try three kinds of play without leaving the cube. The scale is kept low and the challenges are gentle. Its product area is 17'3\" x 12'11\", the safe play area is 22'3\" x 17'11\", and it takes up to 15 children. Climbing, sliding and swinging build balance and upper body strength in early years. Preschools, day-care centres and the toddler corner of a society park are the usual buyers. It carries a 3-year warranty on its main materials. Ask us for a layout drawing.",
